-- German. The planner's first language other than English.
--
-- Dan, 21 August 2026: "Yes please - start with German."
--
-- WHY GERMAN FIRST, when France is the more urgent market. German runs
-- about 15% longer than English across these 433 strings and much more
-- than that on short labels, so it is the length stress test. A layout
-- signed off against Spanish would have been signed off three times and
-- then broken by German.
--
-- WHAT WAS ALREADY TRUE AND SURPRISING. The roi namespace held 433
-- English keys and ZERO rows in any other language, so resolveRoiLang
-- has served English to every non-English reader since the planner was
-- built. The gate was working exactly as designed; nothing had ever been
-- put behind it.
--
-- THE VOCABULARY IS THE SITE'S OWN, not invented here: Vorgabe for
-- mandate, Frist for deadline, Land/Länder for jurisdiction, Stichtag
-- for clearance date. All of it read out of i18n/de.json, because a
-- reader crosses from the tracker to the planner in one click and two
-- vocabularies for one concept is this project's most frequent defect.
--
-- QUOTED SOURCE MATERIAL STAYS IN ENGLISH. The citations quote HMRC,
-- the ATO, APQC, Ardent and the OECD verbatim inside &ldquo;&rdquo;.
-- Translating a quotation and presenting it as what the source says
-- would be worse than leaving it: the prose around it is translated,
-- the quotation is not. That is ordinary scholarly practice and it is
-- also what a CFO checking the citation expects to find.
--
-- BENCHMARK LABELS ARE DELIBERATELY EMPTY. getRoiBenchmarks selects only
-- hint and citation from this table; the visible label comes from the
-- roi namespace's own input.* keys. A standing invariant forbids a
-- non-English label precisely so nobody fills in a field nothing reads.
-- The column is NOT NULL, so it is the empty string rather than NULL.
--
-- GENERATED by gen597.mjs from de-roi.json; the English was never
-- retyped and the German never round-tripped through it.


-- ---- 433 page strings ------------------------------------------------
